      "description": "BIC / SWIFT code after its label (Docudis addition 2026-09-21). Anchored on the label rather than the shape: bare 8-letter uppercase words are everywhere in these documents (CAMPBELL = CAMP+BE+LL parses as a valid BIC), and an unanchored shape rule scored 143 over-redactions across the consumer and public sets.",
